    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "so i was sitting there during the flash dip earlier today and i literally felt this massive spike in my chest, like a super heavy thud, and like a second after that the sell orders just started hitting the tape like crazy. it was so weird... i feel like my heart rate is actually synced up with the volatility cycles lately. does that even make sense? like is there some kind of bio-feedback thing i should be looking into??",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
