      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it wasn't just anxiety or feeling stressed, it was the timing. it was like a physical sensation that happened right before the price actually moved, not after. and it's happened a few times this week now. like, my pulse actually picks up right as the volume spikes. i think there's more to it than just being excited about a trade. do you think there's any way the market's high-frequency stuff could actually be interacting with human biological rhythms? like im not just making this up.",
